{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">LIBRIÑO EXPLICATIVO</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">DOS</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">cadros auxiliares Delmas</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">PRIMEIRA SERIE</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">CADRO N.<sup>o</sup> 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">A escola. — O instituto. — A aula.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Descrición xeral.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — Este cadro representa unha <b>aula</b> nun <b>instituto</b>. Nesta aula hai oito <b>mesas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"mesas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> e oito <b>bancos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"bancos\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. En cada banco sentan tres alumnos. O <b>mestre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"mestre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> senta nunha <b>cadeira</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"cadeira\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> na súa <b>tarima</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"tarima\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — Á esquerda da tarima hai un <b>armario</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armario\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> <b>con vidros.</b> Á dereita está o <b>encerado</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"encerado\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> co seu <b>borrador</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"borrador\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> e o seu <b>xiz</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"xiz\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Por riba da tarima penduran <b>cadros murais</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"cadros murais\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"cadros murais\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"cadros murais\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> e un <b>mapa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"mapa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — Non todos os alumnos están no seu <b>sitio</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"sitio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. Xoán <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> está de pé xunto ao encerado; ten o borrador na man e borra as <b>figuras xeométricas</b>.","t01-03-2":"Pedro está preto da tarima; recolle os <b>exercicios escritos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"exercicios escritos\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> e lévallos ao mestre.","t01-04-1":"4. — Este mestre é o mestre de <b>linguas vivas</b>. Ensínalles aos alumnos a falar, ler e escribir linguas estranxeiras <b>(alemán, inglés, español, italiano, ruso</b> ou <b>francés)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — A aula é moi ampla e moi clara. Ao fondo hai unha <b>ventá</b> larga con dous <b>postigos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"postigos\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> e unha <b>porta de vidro,</b> para airear e alumar a aula.","t01-05-2":"Esta aula non é fría. No medio, para quentala, hai unha <b>estufa</b> moi boa <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"furnelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> co seu <b>tubo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"tubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"Na parede están fixados <b>colgadoiros</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"colgadoiros\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button>; deles penduran os gorros e os abrigos dos escolares.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">O patio de xogo.</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — O <b>reloxo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"reloxo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> marca as nove e cinco minutos.","t01-06-2":"O <b>recreo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"recreo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> acaba de rematar e a lección comeza de novo. O recreo faise no <b>patio</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"patio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. Vemos algúns alumnos que xogan. Un <b>vixiante</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"vixiante\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> vixíaos.","t01-07-1":"7. — No patio vemos ademais persoas diversas, a saber, o <b>inspector</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspector\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, o director <b>(o reitor)</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"(o reitor)\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> e o <b>censor</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"censor\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"O inspector inspecciona as escolas, o reitor dirixe o instituto, o censor vixía os estudos.","t01-07-3":"A cuarta persoa é o <b>porteiro</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"porteiro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. Leva baixo o brazo un rexistro para anotar as ausencias.","t01-08-1":"8. — Ao fondo do patio están os <b>aparellos de ximnasia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"aparellos de ximnasia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> e o taller dos <b>traballos manuais</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"traballos manuais\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"Á dereita do cadro entrevemos as <b>aulas</b> de <b>música</b> e de <b>debuxo</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Descrición detallada.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Os bos alumnos.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — Os alumnos do primeiro banco á dereita da tarima son <b>Henrique</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"gl-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Estevo</b> e <b>Carlos.</b>","t01-09-2":"Henrique é moi atento e traballador; escoita o mestre. Na súa mesa ten un <b>caderno</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"caderno\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, un <b>libro</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"libro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, un <b>dicionario</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"dicionario\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> e un <b>estoxo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"estoxo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. O seu libro ten moitas <b>páxinas</b>; cada capítulo contén varios <b>parágrafos</b>, e cada <b>liña</b> moitas <b>palabras.</b>","t01-09-4":"O seu veciño Estevo <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> é fervoroso. Apunta no seu caderno a lección para a vez seguinte. Ten unha bela <b>letra.</b> O seu libro está pechado. Só vemos a <b>tapa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"tapa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. Xunto a el está o seu <b>compás</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"compás\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"Carlos <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> ten o libro na man; ábreo para reler a súa lección. Ten, coma cada alumno, un <b>tinteiro</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"tinteiro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button> diante de si. É obediente.","t01-10-1":"10. — Na mesa do lado están <b>Lois, Antón</b> e <b>Paulo.</b> Lois recita a súa <b>lección</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"lección\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> e responde ás <b>preguntas</b> do mestre. Antón <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> é moi desatento; ás veces o mestre mesmo o castiga. Paulo <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> é bo <b>compañeiro,</b> amable e servizal. É moi atento.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Os malos alumnos.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Detrás de Henrique está <b>Xurxo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Xurxo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. Non é mal rapaz, pero é <b>falador,</b> desatento e inquedo. A súa <b>lixeireza</b> e a súa <b>desobediencia</b> causan <b>desorde</b> durante a lección, e a miúdo merece unha severa <b>advertencia.</b> O seu <b>caderno de borrancho</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"caderno de borrancho\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> está sucio; <b>mánchao de tinta</b> coa súa <b>pluma</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"pluma\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, e por iso emprega sempre a súa <b>goma de borrar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"goma de borrar\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>; o seu <b>cartafol</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"cartafol\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> está rachado, de descoidado que é. Por que trae a súa <b>estilográfica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"estilográfica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> á aula <b>das</b> linguas vivas?","t01-11-2":"O seu veciño Edmundo <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> non o quere. É certo que é algo indolente, pero é calado e tranquilo. Non anda a falar; mais, en vez de escoitar, prefire ler os <b>contos</b> do seu <b>libro de lectura</b>.","t01-11-3":"O terceiro alumno deste banco é <b>Ludovico</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludovico\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. É diligente. Escribe nunha <b>folla de papel</b> branca. Diante de si puxo o <b>papel secante</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"papel secante\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>.","t01-12-1":"12. — Os alumnos do segundo banco, á esquerda do mestre, son moi novos. O primeiro, o pequeno <b>Emilio,</b> aínda non sabe escribir moi ben; trae a súa <b>lousa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"lousa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, o seu <b>lapis de lousa</b> e a súa <b>esponxa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"esponxa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>.","t01-12-2":"Á beira del están <b>Augusto</b> e <b>Bernardo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernardo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. Este último traballa ben, pero a súa <b>roupa</b> está moi descoidada.","t01-13-1":"13. — Detrás deles están tres <b>preguiceiros. Alberte</b> non aprende as súas leccións. <b>Xacobe</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Xacobe\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> dorme en vez de escoitar. A súa <b>preguiza</b> vállelle <b>reproches</b> e mesmo <b>castigos.</b> Finalmente <b>Cristián</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Cristián\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> é lixeiro de máis. <b>Pórtase</b> mal e non fai ningún esforzo por emendarse.","t01-14-1":"14. — Os seus veciños, pola contra, pórtanse ben. <b>Ernesto</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernesto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> gusta da orde e da regularidade; emprega sempre a súa <b>regra</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"regra\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> e o seu <b>lapis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"lapis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. É <b>alumno externo.</b>","t01-14-2":"<b>Francisco</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Francisco\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> é <b>interno</b>; viste uniforme, come e dorme no instituto. É bo <b>compañeiro.</b>","t01-14-3":"Mauricio afía o seu <b>lapis</b> coa súa <b>navalla</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"navalla\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>; é moi coidadoso.","t01-14-4":"Trae todos os seus libros, a súa <b>gramática</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"gramática\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, o seu <b>caderniño de notas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"caderniño de notas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button> e mesmo un <b>cartapacio</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"cartapacio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. A súa <b>mochila</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"mochila\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> está no chan detrás del.","t01-14-5":"As dúas mesas do fondo da aula están ocupadas polos <b>bos alumnos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"bos alumnos\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Debuxo e música.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — Na <b>aula de debuxo</b> hai <b>modelos</b> graciosos pendurados na parede e unha <b>lámpada</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lámpada\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> coa súa <b>pantalla,</b> colgada do teito. O <b>mestre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"mestre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> é moi paciente; corrixe os <b>debuxos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"debuxos\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> dos alumnos e ensínalles a debuxar do natural un <b>busto</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"busto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button>.","t01-16-1":"16. — A <b>aula de música</b> semella moi interesante. Nela apréndese a ler a <b>música</b>, a solfexar as <b>notas da escala</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"notas da escala\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> escritas no <b>pentagrama</b> (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), a coñecer as <b>claves</b> e a cantar <b>melodías</b> fermosas. Póñense as partituras no <b>atril</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"atril\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button>. Un dos alumnos <b>toca o piano</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"toca o piano\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> e o <b>mestre de música</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"mestre de música\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>marca o compás</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"marca o compás\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Entrevemos un recanto do taller dos <b>traballos manuais</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"traballos manuais\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>, onde os rapaces poden aprender a cepillar a madeira e a limar o ferro. Iso non existe en todos os institutos.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">A aula das ciencias.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — O mestre de matemáticas ensínalles <b>aos</b> alumnos <b>xeometría, aritmética, cálculo</b> e o <b>sistema métrico</b>. Vemos no cadro as principais figuras xeométricas: o <b>círculo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"círculo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, o <b>cadrado</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"cadrado\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, o <b>triángulo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triángulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, a <b>liña</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"liña\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"Vemos tamén unha <b>operación</b>; non é unha <b>suma,</b> nin unha <b>resta,</b> nin unha <b>multiplicación</b>: é unha <b>división</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"división\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>.","t01-19-1":"19. — No cadro do sistema métrico vemos: o <b>metro</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"metro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, a <b>balanza</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balanza\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> e as súas <b>pesas,</b> o <b>litro</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"litro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, o <b>decalitro</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"decalitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, o <b>decilitro</b> e o <b>metro cúbico</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"metro cúbico\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"Os alumnos estudan tamén <b>ciencias naturais</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"cadros murais\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button>, zooloxía <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zooloxía\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, botánica <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botánica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, xeoloxía <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"xeoloxía\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, e a <b>historia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"cadros murais\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"No armario están os aparellos de <b>física</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armario\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> e de <b>química</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"química\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>.","t01-19-4":"Enriba do armario están: a <b>esfera</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"esfera\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, o <b>cono</b> e o <b>globo terráqueo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"globo terráqueo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Por riba dos cadros pendura un <b>mapa</b> que representa as cinco partes do mundo: <b>Europa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>Asia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Asia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>África</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"África\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>América</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"América\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"América\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> e <b>Oceanía</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oceanía\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, e os dous grandes océanos, o <b>Pacífico</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Pacífico\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> e o <b>Atlántico</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlántico\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) Para os <i>nomes de bautismo</i> aconséllase tamén transcribilos segundo a forma latina. Ese é o único xeito de fuxir de variantes sen conta. Ademais, como escoller entre <i>Giovanni, Jean, Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan</i>, etc.? Imos crear un dicionario especial para os nomes de bautismo? Tomemos do latín o seu nominativo e digamos: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Gram. Completa)."}}
